# Biblioteca de Asset Store de Boris (55 paquetes importados 2026-08-11
# como material de partida) — se queda en disco para el editor, pero NO
# se versiona: ~2.3GB, GitHub rechaza el push por tamaño/timeout, y son
# free assets descargables de nuevo, no fuente propia. Solo se versionan
# los ~4 que el spike usa de verdad (ver ADR-003 §Cierre): Starter Assets,
# el warrior de Dagna (asoliddev), el Cliff Pack (BrokenVector), y las
# animaciones RPG (ExplosiveLLC). Si se empieza a usar alguno de los de
# abajo, sacarlo de esta lista antes de commitear.
# Excepcion del lado Godot (2026-08-12): el ciclo de caminata retargeteado
# sale de DoubleL, no de ExplosiveLLC (el walk de ExplosiveLLC viene sin
# esqueleto en el FBX, no se puede mapear). El pack entero sigue ignorado
# aca; lo que se versiona es el unico FBX copiado a
# godot/assets/anim/walk_doublel.fbx.
unity/Assets/ALP_Assets/
unity/Assets/Altar_Ruins_FREE/
unity/Assets/AurynSky/
unity/Assets/Barrels/
unity/Assets/Blink/
unity/Assets/Brawler Animations Sample/
unity/Assets/Daniel Mistage/
unity/Assets/DoubleL/
unity/Assets/Elven Weapons/
unity/Assets/Fantasy Forest Environment Free Sample/
unity/Assets/FastSky/
unity/Assets/FightingMotionsVolume1/
unity/Assets/Free medieval weapons/
unity/Assets/GDS/
unity/Assets/GreatswordofFrozenNight/
unity/Assets/Hovl Studio/
unity/Assets/ithappy/
unity/Assets/Kevin Iglesias/
unity/Assets/L3D_Assets/
unity/Assets/LowPoly Environment Pack/
unity/Assets/LowPoly Nature Pack/
unity/Assets/Medieval Bridge/
unity/Assets/Medieval_Weapons_Collection/
unity/Assets/minotaur1/
unity/Assets/MS_WeaponVol01/
unity/Assets/Packages/
unity/Assets/Polygonal Particles/
unity/Assets/Polytope Studio/
unity/Assets/Rabbits/
unity/Assets/Rotary Heart/
unity/Assets/Seven Swords/
unity/Assets/SimpleNaturePack/
unity/Assets/Skyden_Games/
unity/Assets/StarterParticles/
unity/Assets/StoneKeep/
